type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Following a period of rapid growth through acquisition, Paysafe were looking to achieve enterprise-wide operational efficiencies and alignment. In order to do this, they chose to focus firstly on their customer services, merchant operations, risk and compliance functions.<\/p><p>Paysafe\u2019s fast-paced expansion had resulted in a lack of process consistency &amp; standardisation across their acquired brands. The numerous manual and non-transparent processes at play were something Paysafe were keen to address.<\/p><p>Additionally, in the face of increasing industry regulation and compliance requirements, Paysafe were eager to stay ahead of the curve in responding to these changes, whilst also maintaining the relentless customer focus and agility that is at the core of their DNA.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f4b15f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"f4b15f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-47b03b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"47b03b7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What did \n<br>\nShiksha do<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"vamtam-has-theme-widget-styles elementor-element elementor-element-b1c7ef2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b1c7ef2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Paysafe &amp; Shiksha\u2019s shared appreciation for the power of combining scale and global reach with flexibility and agility made our partnership an obvious choice. Shiksha have been working with Paysafe since November 2020 in 2 key workstreams: <span style=\"color: #242627;\"><b>Automation Delivery<\/b> <\/span>and<span style=\"color: #242627;\"><b> Mobile Chatbot Migration<\/b><\/span>, supporting the Paysafe Automation365 team specialising in Cognitive and Robotic Automation.<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #242627;\"><b>Automation Delivery<\/b><\/span> &#8211; Shiksha are working with the Paysafe Automation365 team to identify, design, build, test and deploy automated solutions using UiPath Automation Software. Thus far Shiksha have delivered 28 Automations across 3 core business functions: Merchant Services, Consumer Services and Risk.<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #242627;\"><b>Mobile ChatBot Migration<\/b><\/span> &#8211; Shiksha led the migration of chatbots from a web browser platform to mobile platforms (Android and iOS). In addition to this, Shiksha has implemented an intermediate communication layer to enable a seamless handoff between chatbot and live agent providers to win and support new deals.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-cf9ca87\" data-id=\"cf9ca87\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-478eaf4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"478eaf4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;sticky&quot;:&quot;top&quot;,&quot;sticky_on&quot;:[&quot;desktop&quot;,&quot;tablet&quo